body:
Super-great to have multi-implementer interest!

@robdodson, your list seems right. (Plus rebasing.) Would you or @alice be able to take over this pull request? Happy to give write access to non-master branches to either of you.

We'll also need web platform tests; they've become a [required part of the working mode](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) since this PR was originally posted. That will be especially good for getting interop on the event behavior (using webdriver to simulate a click).
